# T1.2 direct dependencies (must match pyproject.toml [project].dependencies, no dev extras).
# The cross-platform lock is generated by scripts/lock-deps.ps1|sh with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.10 requirements.in -o requirements.txt
# pip-tools 7.6.x pip-compile has NO --universal option; do not use it (it would drop markers).
# Keep this file ASCII-only: pip/pip-tools decodes it with the system locale (GBK on zh-CN
# Windows), so non-ASCII comments can raise UnicodeDecodeError before installation starts.
